{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In 2025, a child who was about to graduate from junior high school looked at the piles of garbage games he had made. At that moment, he made up his mind to let more people taste the shit he made</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So this is a awesome retro melee game made by a hardworking child who just graduated from junior high school.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hmph, I'm not joking. Considering that I will have less time to pursue my hobbies after entering high school, I want to give it a try during the holidays. The process of the game is not too long, so I won't price it too high. If possible, I would like to use this money to replace my computer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I won't go into too much detail about the game content. You can take a look at the screenshots and promotional videos, after all, no matter how much I boast about it, it cannot be more intuitive than the actual demonstration.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thank you for your support:)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3863870/extras/b5e813012123740c529010d0c13f1b89.avif?t=1762585199\" width=1152 height=864 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3863870?t=1762585199","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3863870/92414c1493059a01a027c8cc286358f8bf9d8566/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1762585199","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3863870/61fd1511e8063494cfd7fa045f43300bb2921535/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762585199","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3863870/61fd1511e8063494cfd7fa045f43300bb2921535/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762585199","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Playabl